<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AAA rating to New Frontier's notes.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA rating to New Frontier's notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Friday that it had assigned its AAA rating to New Frontier Ltd's 20 billion yen 5.32 percent dual-currency notes, maturing on June 2, 2000.</p>
<p>The decision is based primarily on the rating on $159,109,000 in 6.25 percent U.S. Treasury notes due May 31, 2000, and the rating on Morgan Guaranty Trust Co as the swap counterparty, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
